            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>🎵 Musical Instruments</h3>
                <p>Drums, cymbals, and the sound holes in guitars use circular shapes for optimal acoustic properties and resonance.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>💍 Jewelry</h3>
                <p>Rings, bracelets, and circular pendants symbolize eternity and continuity while providing structural strength.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>🏺 Pottery</h3>
                <p>Potter's wheels create perfectly circular vessels. The rotational symmetry makes production efficient and aesthetically pleasing.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-box">
